{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生成模型：从潜变量与对抗学习到 diffusion、flow 与 consistency</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Generative, Diffusion &amp; Flow</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_064_consistency_models-title\">Consistency Models</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">学习沿 PF-ODE 轨迹不变的 endpoint map，使任意噪声尺度可直接一步映射到 clean sample。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Learns a self-consistent function f_θ(x_t, t) = x_ε that maps any point along a Probability-Flow ODE trajectory directly to its clean origin in a single step.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">噪声状态 x_t；蒸馏模式下还需预训练 diffusion score teacher</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Noisy state x_t along a PF-ODE trajectory (distilled from a pretrained score model or trained standalone)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">一次或少数几次函数调用得到的 clean sample</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">One-step or few-step clean sample estimate x̂_0</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v202/song23a.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_064_consistency_models')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_064_consistency_models')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Consistency Models original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/a12b96ff2efcd6b4aff4.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 10 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_064_consistency_models', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_064_consistency_models\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_064_consistency_models')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_064_consistency_models', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_064_consistency_models\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">数据 x0</span><span class=\"lang-en\">x0</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">训练分布样本</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests noisy state x_t along a pf-ode trajectory (distilled from a pretrained score model or trained standalone) and prepares initial tensor representations (x0).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"训练分布样本\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests noisy state x_t along a pf-ode trajectory (distilled from a pretrained score model or trained standalone) and prepares initial tensor representations (x0).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"数据 x0\" data-node-name-en=\"x0\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_064_consistency_models', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">数据 x0</span><span class=\"lang-en\">x0</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">训练分布样本</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests noisy state x_t along a pf-ode trajectory (distilled from a pretrained score model or trained standalone) and prepares initial tensor representations (x0).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在多个时间尺度生成 x_t 与 x_s\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Forward Gaussian Noising to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"前向加噪\" data-node-name-en=\"Forward Gaussian Noising\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_064_consistency_models', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">前向加噪</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Gaussian Noising</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在多个时间尺度生成 x_t 与 x_s</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Forward Gaussian Noising to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"生成时的起始高斯状态\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs noise x_T within the core probability flow consistency computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"噪声 x_T\" data-node-name-en=\"noise x_T\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_064_consistency_models', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">噪声 x_T</span><span class=\"lang-en\">noise x_T</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">生成时的起始高斯状态</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs noise x_T within the core probability flow consistency computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"蒸馏时用 diffusion score teacher 的 probability-flow ODE 连接相邻时间\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Score / PF-ODE within the core probability flow consistency computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Score / PF-ODE\" data-node-name-en=\"Score / PF-ODE\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_064_consistency_models', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Score / PF-ODE</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">蒸馏时用 diffusion score teacher 的 probability-flow ODE 连接相邻时间</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Score / PF-ODE within the core probability flow consistency computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"构造 (x_t,t) 与 (x_s,s)，二者位于同一 PF-ODE 轨迹\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 05 within the core probability flow consistency computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"同轨迹时间对\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 05\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_064_consistency_models', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">同轨迹时间对</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 05</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">构造 (x_t,t) 与 (x_s,s)，二者位于同一 PF-ODE 轨迹</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 05 within the core probability flow consistency computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把任意轨迹点直接映射到共同的 clean endpoint\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs f_theta within the core probability flow consistency computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"一致性函数 f_theta\" data-node-name-en=\"f_theta\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_064_consistency_models', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">一致性函数 f_theta</span><span class=\"lang-en\">f_theta</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把任意轨迹点直接映射到共同的 clean endpoint</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs f_theta within the core probability flow consistency computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"匹配 f_theta(x_t,t) 与 EMA target f_bar(x_s,s)，并满足边界 f(x,epsilon)=x\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs loss within the core probability flow consistency computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"一致性损失\" data-node-name-en=\"loss\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_064_consistency_models', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">一致性损失</span><span class=\"lang-en\">loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">匹配 f_theta(x_t,t) 与 EMA target f_bar(x_s,s)，并满足边界 f(x,epsilon)=x</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs loss within the core probability flow consistency computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"x_T→f_theta(x_T,T)，无需完整 ODE 积分\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 08 within the core probability flow consistency computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"一步路径\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 08\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_064_consistency_models', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">一步路径</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 08</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">x_T→f_theta(x_T,T)，无需完整 ODE 积分</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 08 within the core probability flow consistency computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"输出后再加受控噪声并重复 f_theta 以提升质量\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Stage 09 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"少步路径\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 09\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_064_consistency_models', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">少步路径</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 09</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">输出后再加受控噪声并重复 f_theta 以提升质量</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Stage 09 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"one/few-step clean sample\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces one-step or few-step clean sample estimate x̂_0 via x_hat.\" data-node-idx=\"9\" data-node-name=\"x_hat\" data-node-name-en=\"x_hat\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_064_consistency_models', 9)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">10</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>x_hat</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">one/few-step clean sample</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces one-step or few-step clean sample estimate x̂_0 via x_hat.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Consistency Models Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 概率流轨迹上的端点一致性与边界条件</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Trajectory Self-Consistency f_θ(x_{t_{n+1}}, t_{n+1}) = f_{θ^-}(x_{t_n}, t_n) with Boundary Condition f_θ(x_ε, ε) = x_ε</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Consistency Models：核心公式 · 概率流轨迹上的端点一致性与边界条件\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"64\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"9.278419pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.736752 -69.079189 292.691699 9.278419\" width=\"292.691699pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.208378-6.084282C4.208378-6.451523 3.841137-6.729435 3.354792-6.729435C2.878372-6.729435 2.501206-6.521001 2.143891-6.084282C1.836203-5.687266 1.627769-5.220771 1.330006-4.24808H.416868L.34739-3.930466H1.240677L.367241 .23821C.138956 1.310155-.178658 1.846128-.595525 1.846128C-.71463 1.846128-.794034 1.77665-.794034 1.687321C-.794034 1.64762-.784108 1.627769-.754332 1.578142C-.71463 1.518589-.704705 1.478888-.704705 1.419335C-.704705 1.210901-.883362 1.042169-1.091796 1.042169S-1.459037 1.220827-1.459037 1.449111C-1.459037 1.796501-1.121572 2.054562-.674929 2.054562C.208434 2.054562 .893288 1.081871 1.310155-.754332L2.024786-3.930466H3.106656L3.166209-4.24808H2.09